00:28:38.071 --> 00:28:42.914
We just need to wait for God to take us
into the kingdom of heaven.

00:28:42.939 --> 00:28:44.526
What do you think, brothers and sisters?

00:28:44.550 --> 00:28:47.398
Is it over?

00:28:47.423 --> 00:28:50.969
Is it really over?

00:28:50.993 --> 00:28:52.670
No, right?

00:28:52.695 --> 00:28:54.016
Amen, everybody.

00:28:54.041 --> 00:28:55.671
Absolutely not.

00:28:55.696 --> 00:28:57.365
It is not over.

00:28:57.390 --> 00:29:01.099
You see, because a lot of people will say,
when the Lord Jesus said on the cross,

00:29:01.124 --> 00:29:04.621
it is over, it is finished.

00:29:04.646 --> 00:29:08.042
Doesn't that mean that God's work of
salvation is done?

00:29:08.067 --> 00:29:10.623
Why do we still need more work?

00:29:10.648 --> 00:29:13.478
But brothers
and sisters, let me tell you what the

00:29:13.503 --> 00:29:17.727
true meaning
of it is finished actually refers to.

00:29:17.752 --> 00:29:21.114
It didn't mean that God's work of
salvation was done.

00:29:21.139 --> 00:29:24.665
When
the Lord said, it is finished, he was just

00:29:24.690 --> 00:29:28.292
saying
the work of the crucifixion was done.

00:29:28.317 --> 00:29:31.589
That God's work of redemption was
complete.

00:29:31.614 --> 00:29:37.464
He definitely did not mean that God's
entire work of saving humanity was finished.

00:29:37.489 --> 00:29:40.790
You see, the age of grace has lasted for
2000 years.

00:29:40.815 --> 00:29:44.932
And almost all believers think that just
because the Lord was crucified to redeem

00:29:44.957 --> 00:29:47.719
humanity, that God's work of salvation is
over.

00:29:47.744 --> 00:29:49.265
It ain't over.

00:29:49.290 --> 00:29:50.845
It's not over.

00:29:50.870 --> 00:29:51.734
Right?

00:29:51.759 --> 00:29:54.490
People think, oh, when the Lord comes
back, he's just going to raise us up in

00:29:54.491 --> 00:29:59.589
the air and bring us into the kingdom of
heaven.

00:29:59.614 --> 00:30:01.667
But is that really going to happen?

00:30:01.691 --> 00:30:04.773
Because you
tell me, brothers and sisters, it's true,

00:30:04.798 --> 00:30:08.021
our sins are forgiven
after we have believed in the Lord.

00:30:08.046 --> 00:30:13.417
But did the Lord Jesus completely get rid
of our sinful nature?

00:30:13.442 --> 00:30:16.524
Is our sinful nature transformed?

00:30:16.549 --> 00:30:19.910
Is our sinful nature cleansed,
brothers and sisters?

00:30:19.935 --> 00:30:22.949
There you go.

00:30:22.974 --> 00:30:27.679
Brothers and sisters, you have a great,
great, great understanding.

00:30:27.704 --> 00:30:29.565
Absolutely not.

00:30:29.590 --> 00:30:30.705
Because look at that.

00:30:30.730 --> 00:30:34.448
Even until today, what are we doing?

00:30:34.473 --> 00:30:35.925
Still sinning.

00:30:35.950 --> 00:30:37.125
Right?

00:30:37.150 --> 00:30:41.720
You see, the Holy Spirit worked during the
age of grace for 2000 years.

00:30:41.745 --> 00:30:44.772
Has humanity truly come to know God?

00:30:44.797 --> 00:30:46.111
Think about it, brothers and sisters.

00:30:46.136 --> 00:30:47.793
Have you truly come to know God?

00:30:47.818 --> 00:30:51.294
Would you say that you have true knowledge
of God today?

00:30:51.319 --> 00:30:55.179
Have you reached the point where you no
longer sin?

00:30:55.204 --> 00:30:58.696
Has your corruption really been cleansed?

00:30:58.721 --> 00:31:00.326
I think the answer is all no.

00:31:00.350 --> 00:31:02.411
I agree with you, Brother Anthony.

00:31:02.436 --> 00:31:03.725
Right?

00:31:03.750 --> 00:31:04.901
No.

00:31:04.926 --> 00:31:06.552
So what does this show us?

00:31:06.577 --> 00:31:11.428
It shows us that although
people in the age of grace experience

00:31:11.453 --> 00:31:14.814
the work of the
Holy Spirit, they still cannot escape sin.

00:31:14.839 --> 00:31:16.681
They still cannot attain holiness.

00:31:16.706 --> 00:31:21.130
So therefore, the fact that humanity has
gone through 2000s of years of the

00:31:21.131 --> 00:31:25.643
redemption work of the age of grace
without breaking free from sin is enough

00:31:25.668 --> 00:31:30.041
to prove how deeply mankind has been
corrupted by Satan.

00:31:30.066 --> 00:31:34.790
You see, some people say, but I have
believed in God for 20 or 30 years.

00:31:34.814 --> 00:31:40.238
If I have believed in God my whole life,
I will be able to escape my sinful nature.

00:31:40.263 --> 00:31:42.652
But this viewpoint is not correct.

00:31:42.677 --> 00:31:47.004
Humanity has experienced Jesus' work of
redemption for 2000 years.

00:31:47.029 --> 00:31:53.738
But yet, not a single person has achieved
a change in disposition.

00:31:53.763 --> 00:32:01.714
So therefore, brothers and sisters,
we need God to bring the work of judgment

00:32:01.739 --> 00:32:04.298
and the work of purification in the last
days.

00:32:04.323 --> 00:32:10.277
Because remember, what are the
requirements to enter God's kingdom?

00:32:10.302 --> 00:32:12.103
Isn't it to be holy?

00:32:12.128 --> 00:32:15.004
Isn't it to obey God and live out the word
of God?

00:32:15.029 --> 00:32:17.685
Isn't it to be holy and be purified?

00:32:17.710 --> 00:32:21.316
Isn't it to stop sinning and to live free
from sin?

00:32:21.341 --> 00:32:23.025
Absolutely.

00:32:23.050 --> 00:32:24.122
Right?

00:32:24.147 --> 00:32:25.963
It's all the above.

00:32:25.987 --> 00:32:27.680
Take
a look at the picture that I'm about to

00:32:27.705 --> 00:32:30.505
send
to you right now, brothers and sisters.

00:32:30.530 --> 00:32:32.457
Have a look.

00:32:32.481 --> 00:32:36.777
Sin is our outer behavior.

00:32:36.802 --> 00:32:42.685
Like lying, blasphemy, slander,
theft, jealousy.

00:32:42.710 --> 00:32:44.340
Adultery.

00:32:44.365 --> 00:32:45.574
Those are all sin.

00:32:45.599 --> 00:32:47.066
But what about the sinful nature?

00:32:47.090 --> 00:32:49.393
What's deeply hidden inside of us?

00:32:49.418 --> 00:32:53.649
Arrogance, vanity, hypocrisy,
self-righteousness, greed, selfishness.

00:32:53.674 --> 00:32:55.197
That's all inside of us.

00:32:55.222 --> 00:33:00.067
You see, even though the Lord Jesus was
crucified as our sin offering to redeem

00:33:00.092 --> 00:33:03.224
us, remember, our sinful nature was not
cleansed.

00:33:03.249 --> 00:33:05.549
We're all driven by the sinful nature.

00:33:05.574 --> 00:33:09.722
We live in our corrupt dispositions every
single day.

00:33:09.747 --> 00:33:11.279
We still constantly lie.

00:33:11.304 --> 00:33:12.674
We fight for fame and gain.

00:33:12.699 --> 00:33:13.689
We feel jealous.

00:33:13.714 --> 00:33:14.890
We get into arguments.

00:33:14.915 --> 00:33:17.078
We act arrogant and self-righteous.

00:33:17.103 --> 00:33:21.941
And even though we don't want to,
right?

00:33:21.966 --> 00:33:23.973
We don't want to, but we still do it.

00:33:23.997 --> 00:33:26.734
Because it's in our sinful nature.

00:33:26.759 --> 00:33:28.192
We want to be tolerant.

00:33:28.217 --> 00:33:29.538
We want to be patient.

00:33:29.563 --> 00:33:31.393
But we just can't do it.

00:33:31.418 --> 00:33:35.267
We want to love others as ourselves,
but we can't.

00:33:35.292 --> 00:33:37.422
We can't put it into practice.

00:33:37.447 --> 00:33:40.240
And loving and submitting to the Lord,
that's even tougher.

00:33:40.265 --> 00:33:44.791
So even though people have enjoyed much of
God's grace and had their sins forgiven,

00:33:44.816 --> 00:33:47.513
they still don't know how to fear God and
shun evil.

00:33:47.538 --> 00:33:49.800
They still don't know how to follow God's
way.

00:33:49.825 --> 00:33:53.943
And no matter how devout, patient,
or loving someone may seem on the outside,

00:33:53.968 --> 00:33:57.319
the root of their resistance to God is
still there.

00:33:57.343 --> 00:33:59.202
Completely unchanged.

00:33:59.227 --> 00:34:02.540
You see, people have no path or power to
cast off sin.

00:34:02.565 --> 00:34:05.450
They're
just stuck in a vicious cycle of

00:34:05.475 --> 00:34:08.724
sinning
by the day and confessing by the night.

00:34:08.749 --> 00:34:10.095
So now think.

00:34:10.120 --> 00:34:14.234
Can someone living in sin like this really
be considered saved?

00:34:14.259 --> 00:34:17.683
Are they qualified to get into the kingdom
of heaven?

00:34:17.708 --> 00:34:19.514
No.

00:34:19.539 --> 00:34:21.391
Absolutely not.

00:34:21.416 --> 00:34:22.298
Right?

00:34:22.323 --> 00:34:23.835
Exactly, Sister Pamela.

00:34:23.860 --> 00:34:25.848
It's just as the Lord Jesus said.

00:34:25.873 --> 00:34:30.942
Truly, truly, I say to you, whoever
commits sin is the servant of sin.

00:34:30.967 --> 00:34:35.342
And the servant stays not in the house
forever, but the son stays ever.

00:34:35.367 --> 00:34:37.860
John 8, 34-35.

00:34:37.885 --> 00:34:40.305
You shall therefore be holy, for I am
holy.

00:34:40.330 --> 00:34:42.295
Leviticus 11, 45.

00:34:42.320 --> 00:34:45.743
Holiness without which no man shall see
the Lord.

00:34:45.768 --> 00:34:47.970
Hebrews 12, 45.

00:34:47.995 --> 00:34:50.440
Don't we have a righteous and holy God?

00:34:50.465 --> 00:34:53.132
How could
he possibly allow people who constantly

00:34:53.157 --> 00:34:55.890
sin
and resist him to enter his kingdom?

00:34:55.915 --> 00:35:00.114
So, after finishing the work of
redemption, the Lord Jesus prophesied

00:35:00.139 --> 00:35:03.803
multiple, multiple times that he would
come back.

00:35:03.828 --> 00:35:08.053
That he's coming back to do a stage of
judgment work in the last days.

00:35:08.078 --> 00:35:10.514
To completely cleanse and save humanity.

00:35:10.539 --> 00:35:14.165
To bring his people into his kingdom.

00:35:14.190 --> 00:35:16.573
It's just as the Lord prophesied.

00:35:16.598 --> 00:35:23.525
He said, I have yet many things to say to
you, but you cannot bear them now.

00:35:23.550 --> 00:35:29.864
However, when he, the spirit of truth,
is come, he will guide you into all truth.

00:35:29.890 --> 00:35:32.331
John 16, 12-13.

00:35:32.356 --> 00:35:35.950
Sanctify them through your truth.

00:35:35.975 --> 00:35:38.585
Your word is truth.

00:35:38.610 --> 00:35:42.127
John 17, 17.

00:35:42.152 --> 00:35:48.275
He that rejects me and accepts not my
words has one that judges him.

00:35:48.300 --> 00:35:52.566
The word that I have spoken, the same
shall judge him in the last day.

00:35:52.590 --> 00:35:54.432
John 12, 48.

00:35:54.457 --> 00:35:56.435
Isn't it clear, brothers and sisters?

00:35:56.460 --> 00:36:01.011
When you really focus in the word of the
Lord, you could really have a path forward.

00:36:01.036 --> 00:36:05.436
When the Lord comes back, he's going to
express more truth.

00:36:05.461 --> 00:36:07.855
He's going to do a stage of judgment work.

00:36:07.880 --> 00:36:10.093
To guide his people into all truth.

00:36:10.118 --> 00:36:13.305
So that means he's going to completely
save us from sin.

00:36:13.330 --> 00:36:15.785
Deliver us from Satan's influence.

00:36:15.810 --> 00:36:19.062
And bring us into God's kingdom.

00:36:19.087 --> 00:36:23.811
And this is a stage of work that God
actually already planned long ago.

00:36:23.836 --> 00:36:25.625
And that's his final work.

00:36:25.650 --> 00:36:28.212
There's no more work after this,
brothers and sisters.

00:36:28.237 --> 00:36:32.025
You see, this stage of work, it's not about
issuing laws and commandments anymore.

00:36:32.050 --> 00:36:34.739
It's not about giving humanity abundant
grace.

00:36:34.765 --> 00:36:38.545
Instead, it is the work of chastisement and judgment.

00:36:38.570 --> 00:36:41.298
It's about disciplining mankind now.

00:36:41.323 --> 00:36:48.665
And only the work of chastisement and
judgment can get rid of Satan's poison and sinful nature.

00:36:48.690 --> 00:36:50.986
Resolve our corruptions.

00:36:51.011 --> 00:36:54.208
And completely gain humanity.

00:36:54.233 --> 00:36:59.028
And finally, conclude God's 6,000 year
management plan.

00:36:59.053 --> 00:37:02.758
And you know what this stage of work is
called, brothers and sisters?

00:37:02.783 --> 00:37:04.196
Exactly, brother Michael.

00:37:04.221 --> 00:37:06.289
It's his management plan.

00:37:06.314 --> 00:37:16.545
And the third stage in which he perfects
people, it is called the age of kingdom.

00:37:16.570 --> 00:37:19.070
That's right, brothers and sisters.

00:37:19.095 --> 00:37:23.230
It is the age of kingdom.

00:37:23.255 --> 00:37:27.038
You see, my beloved brothers and sisters,
what is the age of kingdom?

00:37:27.069 --> 00:37:32.688
Brothers and sisters, the age of kingdom
is what?

00:37:32.719 --> 00:37:36.353
It's the training of the kingdom.

00:37:36.378 --> 00:37:41.530
This is where God will finally train us
how to be holy.

00:37:41.555 --> 00:37:43.509
Teach us how to be righteous.

00:37:43.534 --> 00:37:47.602
We still have to go through the training of
the kingdom in order to get to the kingdom.

00:37:47.627 --> 00:37:49.713
Isn't that right, brothers and sisters?

00:37:49.738 --> 00:37:52.136
Because think about it, brothers and
sisters.

00:37:52.161 --> 00:37:55.452
Let's say you play a sport.

00:37:55.477 --> 00:37:56.893
You play soccer.

00:37:56.918 --> 00:37:58.466
You know, FIFA World Cup is going on.

00:37:58.490 --> 00:37:59.130
You play soccer.

00:37:59.131 --> 00:37:59.755
You play soccer.

00:37:59.780 --> 00:38:05.541
If you never go to practice, do you think
the coach is going to put you in the field?

00:38:05.566 --> 00:38:07.344
Brothers and sisters?

00:38:07.369 --> 00:38:08.977
If
you never attend the practice, do you think

00:38:08.978 --> 00:38:10.665
the
coach is going to put you in the field?

00:38:10.690 --> 00:38:11.690
No, right?

00:38:11.715 --> 00:38:13.130
Exactly.

00:38:13.155 --> 00:38:14.545
Exactly.

00:38:14.569 --> 00:38:17.352
Now,
the Lord prophesied that he's coming back

00:38:17.377 --> 00:38:19.424
in
order to carry out the work of judgment.

00:38:19.449 --> 00:38:25.162
If you do not accept his judgment work,
do you think you can enter his kingdom?

00:38:25.187 --> 00:38:29.851
Once again, big no-no.

00:38:29.876 --> 00:38:31.370
Big no-no.

00:38:31.390 --> 00:38:33.446
Ain't that right, brothers and sisters?

00:38:33.471 --> 00:38:34.653
Exactly.

00:38:34.678 --> 00:38:38.904
That's why we've got to go through the
training of the kingdom.

00:38:38.930 --> 00:38:40.390
All right?

00:38:40.415 --> 00:38:44.345
So, let's listen to two spiritual passages
together.

00:38:44.370 --> 00:38:49.339
Why the training of the kingdom,
the age of kingdom, is so important.

00:38:49.364 --> 00:38:50.390
Okay?

00:38:50.415 --> 00:38:52.099
I'll wait till we all get it.

00:38:52.124 --> 00:38:53.316
And I'll play.

00:38:53.341 --> 00:38:54.451
I'll play the audio.

00:38:54.476 --> 00:39:02.201
Though Jesus did much work among man,
he only completed the redemption of all

00:39:02.226 --> 00:39:06.920
mankind
and became man's sin offering and

00:39:06.945 --> 00:39:11.895
did not
rid man of all his corrupt disposition.

00:39:11.920 --> 00:39:19.310
Fully saving man from the influence of
Satan not only required Jesus to take on

00:39:19.311 --> 00:39:27.047
the sins of man as the sin offering,
but also required God to do greater work

00:39:27.072 --> 00:39:34.136
to completely rid man of his disposition,
which has been corrupted by Satan.

00:39:34.161 --> 00:39:42.770
And so, after man was forgiven his sins,
God has returned to flesh to lead man into

00:39:42.771 --> 00:39:48.185
the new age and begun the work of
chastisement and judgment.

00:39:48.210 --> 00:39:53.509
And this work has brought man into a
higher realm.

00:39:53.534 --> 00:39:57.448
All
those who submit under his dominion shall

00:39:57.449 --> 00:40:02.272
enjoy
higher truth and receive greater blessings.

00:40:02.297 --> 00:40:12.344
They shall truly live in the light and
shall gain the truth, the way, and the life.

00:40:12.370 --> 00:40:13.721
Amen.

00:40:13.746 --> 00:40:14.766
One more.

00:40:14.791 --> 00:40:17.372
Let's listen to the second one.

00:40:17.397 --> 00:40:20.080
Amen, amen.

00:40:20.105 --> 00:40:23.018
Here we go, brothers and sisters.

00:40:23.043 --> 00:40:30.475
By means of this work of judgment and
chastisement, man will fully come to know

00:40:30.500 --> 00:40:35.291
the filthy and
corrupt essence within his own self

00:40:35.292 --> 00:40:41.774
and he will be
able to change completely and become clean.

00:40:41.799 --> 00:40:49.414
Only in this way can man become worthy to
return before the throne of God.

00:40:49.439 --> 00:40:56.728
All the work done this day is so that man
can be made clean and be changed.

00:40:56.753 --> 00:41:03.242
Through judgment and chastisement by the
word, as well as through refinement,

00:41:03.267 --> 00:41:09.085
man can purge away his corruption and be
made pure.

00:41:09.110 --> 00:41:10.800
Amen.

00:41:10.825 --> 00:41:13.494
Amen, brothers and sisters.

00:41:13.519 --> 00:41:15.518
Look at that, right?

00:41:15.543 --> 00:41:16.785
Why?

00:41:16.810 --> 00:41:20.512
Why does God need to do the work of
judgment?

00:41:20.537 --> 00:41:25.200
It's
because the Lord Jesus' work of redemption,

00:41:25.225 --> 00:41:28.197
it
didn't get rid of our sinful nature.

00:41:28.222 --> 00:41:32.079
It didn't completely save us from Satan's
corruption.

00:41:32.104 --> 00:41:35.165
So God's work of saving humanity,
it's not over.

00:41:35.190 --> 00:41:40.771
He still needs to do a stage of judgment
work to completely cleanse and save people.

00:41:40.796 --> 00:41:45.062
So from this, we can see that the Lord
Jesus' work of redemption was simply

00:41:45.087 --> 00:41:49.020
paving the way for the work of judgment in
the last days.

00:41:49.045 --> 00:41:52.225
And
the work of judgment, it is the last,

00:41:52.226 --> 00:41:55.931
most
crucial part of God's work of salvation.

00:41:55.956 --> 00:42:00.417
It is the only path for humanity to be
saved and enter the kingdom of heaven.

00:42:00.442 --> 00:42:03.377
So
speaking of judgment, brothers and sisters,

00:42:03.378 --> 00:42:05.885
does
anyone remember how God judges us?

00:42:05.910 --> 00:42:09.396
But before we talk about that,
let me just give you a diagram.

00:42:09.421 --> 00:42:13.962
Jesus' work of redemption only forgave
mankind's sin.

00:42:13.987 --> 00:42:16.311
Man still has sinful nature.

00:42:16.336 --> 00:42:19.222
So man needs to accept the work of
judgment.

00:42:19.247 --> 00:42:26.079
Man needs to be purified in order to enter
the kingdom of heaven.

00:42:26.104 --> 00:42:28.691
You see that, my dear brothers and
sisters?

00:42:28.716 --> 00:42:32.005
It's greatly, greatly important.

00:42:32.030 --> 00:42:34.296
Amen, Cody.

00:42:34.321 --> 00:42:36.505
Amen, brothers and sisters.

00:42:36.530 --> 00:42:37.530
Amen.

00:42:37.555 --> 00:42:41.814
So, my dear brothers and sisters,
does anyone remember?

00:42:41.839 --> 00:42:46.065
What does God use to do the work of
judgment to cleanse us?

00:42:46.090 --> 00:42:48.083
What does he use?

00:42:48.108 --> 00:42:50.442
Who remembers?

00:42:50.467 --> 00:42:52.650
How are we going to be cleansed?

00:42:52.651 --> 00:42:56.493
With what?

00:42:56.518 --> 00:43:00.722
I think some of you
guys... Ah, there you go, Brother Michael.

00:43:00.747 --> 00:43:05.319
Brother Michael says we will be cleansed
with the truth.

00:43:05.345 --> 00:43:07.435
Not natural disasters, Brother Warren.

00:43:07.460 --> 00:43:09.841
Natural disasters can kill you.

00:43:09.866 --> 00:43:13.369
Only the word of God can cleanse you,
my dear brother.

00:43:13.394 --> 00:43:15.895
Only the truth can set you free.

00:43:15.920 --> 00:43:17.065
