00:59:34.351 --> 00:59:45.580
The first one says, I am Alpha and Omega,
the beginning and the ending, said the Lord

00:59:45.611 --> 00:59:52.618
which is, which was, and which is to
come, the Almighty.

00:59:52.643 --> 00:59:54.362
