00:59:54.387 --> 01:00:00.162
And I heard as they were the voice of a
great multitude, and as the voice of many

01:00:00.187 --> 01:00:03.428
waters, and as the voice of mighty
fountains.

01:00:03.453 --> 01:00:09.396
Saying, hallelujah for the Lord God
Almighty's reigns.

01:00:09.421 --> 01:00:11.927
Revelation 19.6.

01:00:11.952 --> 01:00:18.706
