another out of the altar say, even so, Lord God Almighty,

01:00:18.731 --> 01:00:22.426

true and righteous are your judgments.

01:00:22.451 --> 01:00:25.628
Revelation 16.7.

01:00:25.653 --> 01:00:30.861
Saying,
we give you thanks, O Lord God Almighty,

01:00:30.886 --> 01:00:34.039
Which
are and were, and are, and are to come.

01:00:34.064 --> 01:00:40.550
Because you have taken to you your great
power and have reigned.

01:00:40.575 --> 01:00:43.619
Revelation 11, 17.

01:00:43.644 --> 01:00:48.450
Brothers and
sisters, based on these four verses,

01:00:48.481 --> 01:00:53.912
what is God's name
in the age of kingdom of the last days?

01:01:02.435 --> 01:01:05.580
What do you think, brothers and sisters?

01:01:05.605 --> 01:01:07.557
Did anyone catch it?

01:01:07.582 --> 01:01:09.962
Oh, Brother Michael caught it.

01:01:09.987 --> 01:01:12.579
Anthony caught it.

01:01:12.604 --> 01:01:15.762
Anyone catch it, brothers and sisters?

01:01:15.787 --> 01:01:17.346
Yeah.

01:01:17.371 --> 01:01:18.855
It's right there in front of you.

01:01:18.880 --> 01:01:19.893
Who caught it?

01:01:19.918 --> 01:01:22.227
Michael and Anthony so far caught it.

01:01:22.252 --> 01:01:25.115
Clifton also caught it.

01:01:25.140 --> 01:01:26.439
Yeah.

01:01:26.464 --> 01:01:28.155
Clifton also caught it.

01:01:28.180 --> 01:01:31.186
Anyone else?

01:01:31.211 --> 01:01:34.904
